msgid "发布规范"
msgstr "Release policy"

msgid "版本与范围"
msgstr "Version and scope"

msgid ""
"发布版本由本仓 configs/build-version 的版本提交确定，标签为 v<版本>。 更新范围严格为（上一版本提交，本次版本提交]。独立检查两仓历史，合并去重， "
"只汇总最终生效功能；不列版本号更新、纯 merge 或纯 gitlink 等机械条目。 ReliefOS 只写主仓内容，ReliefNT 只写内核内容。 "
"起点不唯一时列出具体提交选项并由维护者决定。"
msgstr ""
"The release version is determined by this repository's version commit for configs/build-version, "
"tagged v<version>. The change range is strictly (previous version commit, current version commit]."
" Inspect both repositories independently, merge and deduplicate, and summarize only features that "
"remain effective. Omit mechanical entries such as version bumps, pure merges, and gitlink-only "
"changes. ReliefOS notes cover only this repository; ReliefNT notes cover only the kernel. If the "
"starting point is ambiguous, list concrete commit options for the maintainer to choose."

msgid "说明与验证"
msgstr "Notes and validation"

msgid ""
"正文依次包含“更新内容”“破坏性更新”“更新与迁移注意事项”“开发者提示”。 破坏性更新明确写是、否或尚未确认，列明路径、ABI、数据或工作流影响。 规范原文归档为 "
"Documentation/releases/<版本>.rst；GitHub Release 使用 经审阅、内容相同的 Markdown 正文文件，可暂存在输出目录，不新增第二套手册。 "
"源码发布不附二进制；只有明确选择时才从本版本重建并附校验和及归属。"
msgstr ""
"The body contains, in order, Changes, Breaking changes, Update and migration notes, and Developer "
"notes. Breaking changes must explicitly be yes, no, or unconfirmed, stating impacts on paths, ABI,"
" data, or workflows. Archive the canonical source in Documentation/releases/<版本>.rst. GitHub "
"Releases use a reviewed Markdown body with the same content, optionally staged in the output "
"directory; do not add a second manual. Source releases have no binaries attached; rebuild from "
"that version and attach checksums and attribution only when explicitly selected."

msgid "核对主仓 VERSION_ID、两仓版本生成与数字宏；不改变 ABI golden 或音频策略 掩盖失败。编译、打包、QEMU、VMware 逐层报告，未验证明确注明。"
msgstr ""
"Check this repository's VERSION_ID, version generation in both repositories, and numeric macros. "
"Do not alter ABI golden data or audio policy to hide failures. Report compilation, packaging, "
"QEMU, and VMware separately, explicitly marking unverified layers."

msgid "提交与发布顺序"
msgstr "Commit and release order"

msgid ""
"只有用户明确授权才提交、推送、建分支或发布。先提交验证并推送 ReliefNT， 再更新父仓 gitlink、提交推送 ReliefOS。标签指向各自完整版本提交 SHA， "
"不能误用默认分支或擅自合并开发分支。已有标签和 Release 不静默重写。"
msgstr ""
"Commit, push, create branches, or publish only with explicit user authorization. Commit, validate,"
" and push ReliefNT first, then update the parent gitlink and commit and push ReliefOS. Tags must "
"point to each repository's complete version-commit SHA; do not accidentally use the default branch"
" or merge development branches without authorization. Never silently rewrite existing tags or "
"Releases."

msgid ""
"通过 gh release create 的 verify-tag、target 和 notes-file 参数发布；预发布 另标 "
"prerelease。回读确认标签解析的提交、正文、状态及附件，不以命令已发出 替代发布成功。"
msgstr ""
"Publish with gh release create using verify-tag, target, and notes-file; mark prereleases with "
"prerelease. Read back and verify the tag's resolved commit, body, status, and attachments. Issuing"
" the command alone does not establish a successful release."
